   <standOff><listPerson><person xml:id="person3829"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">po to ba rin chen gsal</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">པོ་ཏོ་བ་རིན་ཆེན་གསལ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">pu to ba</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rin chen gsal</persName><birth notBefore="1027-01-01" notAfter="1027-12-31">1027</birth><death notBefore="1105-01-01" notAfter="1105-12-31">1105</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P3442</idno><idno type="APIS">3829</idno><note type="comment">Part of the group called  the "three brothers" (sku mched gsum), composed of Po to ba (ID:3829), Phu chung ba (ID:7093), Spyan snga ba (ID:3830).</note></person><person xml:id="person3855"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dus gsum mkhyen pa</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">དུས་གསུམ་མཁྱེན་པ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">karma pa dus gsum mkhyen</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dpal chos kyi grags pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">grub thob dbu se</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bla ma dbu se</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rin po che</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gnas nang pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">khams pa se bo</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mtshur phu ba</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">grub thob rnam 'byor</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zhwa nag pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dge 'phel</persName><birth notBefore="1110-01-01" notAfter="1110-12-31">1110</birth><death notBefore="1193-01-01" notAfter="1193-12-31">1193</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P1400</idno><idno type="APIS">3855</idno><note type="comment">First Karmapa.&#13;
His birth name was dGe 'phel ([Y6NGTTC6]: 24). His alternative names and epithets are listed in [Y6NGTTC6]: 5 and 27, which also lists the main information on his life found in early sources.&#13;
Dus gsum mkhyen pa (ID:3855), Sho sgom (ID:3857), and Phag mo gru pa (ID:3856) are known as the "grub thob mi gsum" and as the "khams pa mi gsum." According to Dus gsum mkhyen pa'i rnam thar in Si tu Chos kyi 'byung gnas's Karma kam tshang gser 'phreng (cited in [I58Z22ET]: 408, n. 42), Dus gsum mkhyen became known as one of the "khams pa mi gsum" during his stays in gSang phu (ID:4332) (gsang phur yang bzhugs te | khams pa mi gsum du grags |).</note></person><person xml:id="person4108"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">lce sgom rdzong pa shes rab rdo rje</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ལྕེ་སྒོམ་རྫོང་པ་ཤེས་རབ་རྡོ་རྗེ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">lce sgom rdzong pa mkha' skyongs grags pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bla ma rin che lce sgom rdzong pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">lce sgom rdzong pa shes rab rdo rje</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">btsun pa shes rab rdo rje</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">lce</persName><birth notBefore="1130-01-01" notAfter="1130-12-31">1130</birth><death notBefore="1130-01-01" notAfter="1210-12-31">after 1130 before 1210</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P4892</idno><idno type="APIS">4108</idno></person><person xml:id="person4593"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">Anonymous</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཨཱནོཉམོཨུས</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">4593</idno></person><person xml:id="person5354"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">kyi ston dpal ldan rdo rje</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཀྱི་སྟོན་དཔལ་ལྡན་རྡོ་རྗེ</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">5354</idno><note type="comment">Maybe for "skyi ston dpal ldan rdo rje."</note></person><person xml:id="person6320"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">Anonymous</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཨཱནོཉམོཨུས</persName><birth notBefore="1085-01-01">after 1085</birth><death notAfter="1700-12-31">before 1700</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">6320</idno><note type="comment">Annotator of a manuscript (ID:4570) of dBu ma rigs pa'i tshogs kyi rgyan de kho na nyid snang ba.&#13;
